Selected upstream files: recursive *.go, go.mod, go.sum, LICENSE.
Local patch: scripts/patches/sing-snell.patch, applied by scripts/sync-sing-snell.sh.
The patch adds bounded multi-PSK recognition for v5/v6, connection-bound response
keys, admission callbacks on native reuse, shared authentication budgets and
replay state, bounded HTTP obfuscation parsing, and protocol verification tests,
including the v6 first-record shape vectors the OBoard Controller copy must match.
It also exports ContextWithKeepSession for the sing-box urltest import. The local
reuse path does not read that flag.
The original single-PSK and userkey services retain their distinct semantics.
No sing-box replacement or standalone server is included.
